  "title": "Fury Drilling at Committee Bay Extends Three Bluffs Mineralization and Expands Raven Target - Fury Gold Mines Limited",
  "summary": "TORONTO, Canada – November 10, 2025 – Fury Gold Mines Limited (TSX and NYSE American: FURY) (“Fury” or the “Company”) announces the results from the 2025 exploration drilling program at the Committee Bay project, located in the eastern Kitikmeot region of Nunavut, Canada (Figure 1). The 2025 drilling program comprised six (6) diamond drill holes totaling approximately 2,778 metres (m). […]",
